  "text_pages": [
    "Courses Autumn 2026/27 in English - IO Platform\nZum Inhalt springen.\nNavigation\nEnglish Taught Programmes and Courses\nAutumn 2026/27\nAt the FHNW School of Business, you will find a wide variety of English speaking courses from all the different programmes.\nNOTE: all courses and timetables are subject to changes without notice.\nExchange students may choose from a pool of courses from our different programmes and campuses. However, when choosing courses from different campuses, please bear in mind the distance between them and watch out for inconsistencies and clashes when preparing your schedule so you do not have two classes at the same time.\nCampus Basel\nBSc International Business Management\nCourse Offer\nCourse Descriptions\nWebsite – Module overview\nAcademic Calendar\nTimetable\nBSc Business Information Technology\nCourse Offer\nCourse Descriptions\nWebsite – Module overview\nAcademic Calendar\nTimetable\nCampus Brugg-Windisch\nBSc Business Administration (International Management)\nCourse Offer\nCourse Descriptions\nWebsite – Module overview\nAcademic Calendar\nTimetable\nBSc Business Information Technology\nCourse Offer\nCourse Descriptions\nWebsite – Module overview\nAcademic Calendar\nTimetable\nCampus Olten\nBSc Business Administration (International Management)\nCourse Offer\nCourse Descriptions\nWebsite – Module overview\nAcademic Calendar\nTimetable\n* Any files that may be missing below will be available as soon as they are ready.\nFooter\nSuche schliessen\nSuche\nPlease enter your search term\nThis website uses cookies (see\nData Privacy\n). You can adjust the use of cookies in the\nSettings\n.\nBy closing this notice or continuing to browse the site you consent to the use of cookies.\nOK\nCookie-Einstellungen\nFor this website, we distinguish between essential cookies (which are used to ensure error-free use of the site, so that all functionalities are available), as well as statistics and marketing cookies (which allow us to understand and optimise the use of our offerings and promotional opportunities).\nYou can find more information at\nData Privacy\n.\nAllow only essential cookies\nAllow all cookies\nscroll back to the top"
